# Dev server guard (Schoonmaker / MeWorld game)

## The bugs (2026-06-10)

| Symptom | Cause |
|---------|--------|
| **"Not launching"** / API crash | Port **3001** already in use (`EADDRINUSE`) |
| Game on **5178**, styles/API broken | Zombie Vite on **5173–5177** — new `npm run dev` picks next port; user still opens **5173** |
| **Blank white page** (entire app) | JS parse error (e.g. duplicate `const` in `caseDiscussionContext.js`) — bundle never mounts React |
| White differential only | CSS guard issue — see `component-css-guard.mdc` |
| **`predev` fails — `Expected ")" but found "{"` in `DifferentialPractice.jsx`** | Two JSX roots in one `return` (e.g. main div + `DifferentialDrillPanel`) without `<>...</>`. Run `npm run smoke:pre-serve` after any differential JSX edit |
| **`voice-note/status` — operation aborted (timeout)** | Live smoke hits `/api/voice-note/status` with 8s limit while API probes local Whisper on first request. Usually passes on **second** `npm run dev`; fix env if it never passes |

## Canonical URLs (only these)

| Service | URL |
|---------|-----|
| **Game** | http://localhost:5173/ |
| **API** | http://127.0.0.1:3001 |

**Never** tell Steve to use 5174, 5178, etc. If Vite prints another port, **stop and free ports** — do not proceed.

## Before starting dev (agents)

```powershell
Set-Location C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\game
npm run dev
```

`npm run dev` runs **`free-dev-ports`** first (kills listeners on 3001 + 5173), then `predev` (build:data + smoke-test), then API + Vite.

**Do not** spawn extra `node server/index.js` or bare `vite` in parallel — one `npm run dev` only. Bypassing smoke leaves broken JSX running until Steve hits a white screen.

**"Run MeWorld"** = `C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\START-GAME.bat` → http://localhost:5173/ (main game). Not teleprompter-station (:8765). Not ECG lab unless Steve asks for `/ecg-vector-lab.html`.

Manual free if needed:

```powershell
node scripts/free-dev-ports.mjs
```

## Before telling Steve UI is ready (mandatory)

`npm run dev` **will not keep serving** unless every gate passes:

| Phase | Script | When |
|-------|--------|------|
| **predev** | `build:data` + `smoke-test.mjs` + `smoke-pre-serve.mjs` | Before any server starts |
| **pre-serve** | CSS audit + `vite build` | Catches JS errors → white screen |
| **live API** | `validate-diff-smoke.mjs` | After API up, before Vite |
| **live UI** | `smoke-differential-session.mjs` | After Vite up — Playwright + screenshots |

If any phase fails, **`start-dev.mjs` kills servers and exits 1** — nothing is left running on a broken build.

Manual re-check (servers must already be up for live phases):

```powershell
npm run smoke:pre-serve
npm run smoke:differential
npm run smoke:differential-session
```

## After killing stale processes

Background terminal tasks may show exit code **4294967295** — expected when clearing zombie node. Verify live servers:

```powershell
Invoke-WebRequest http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/health -UseBasicParsing
Invoke-WebRequest http://localhost:5173/ -UseBasicParsing
```

Both must return **200** before asking Steve to refresh.

## Steve launch

`C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\START-GAME.bat` → `npm run dev` (includes port free).
